accTitle: Buffer work independently of durable files
accDescr: Uploads persist in S3; an SQS queue carries references to replaceable workers and drives a scaling feedback loop.
U[Upload API] -->|File| S[(S3 uploads)]
U -->|Object reference| Q[SQS queue]
Q --> W[Multi-AZ worker group]
W -->|Read file| S
W -->|Complete then delete message| Q
Q -.->|Visible backlog| M[Backlog per worker]
W -.->|Running capacity| M
M -.->|Scaling policy| W
S -->|Asynchronous CRR| R[(Recovery Region S3)]
class U inputData
class S,R storage
class M decision
class W output
